memory remove chip rom_chip
memory remove chip variable_storage

memory create chip ram_chip 0x8000 8      
memory create chip rom_chip 0x2000 8     
memory create chip via_chip 0x0400 8       
memory create chip uart_chip 0x0400 8

memory create addressdecoder rom 0x0000 0x7fff ram_chip 0x0000 
memory create addressdecoder rom 0x8000 0x83ff via_chip  0x0000 
memory create addressdecoder rom 0xe000 0xffff rom_chip 0x0000 
memory create addressdecoder rom 0x8400 0x87ff uart_chip 0x0000
